        "content": {
          "type": "Text",
          "format": "html",
          "text": [
            "<p>Now, you will develop your program by changing the tiles in your subtraction machine (you might want to rename it, too!)</p><p>Does one of these blocks match the idea you designed?</p><p>If not, try some other blocks and experiment with a new idea.</p><p>You can also ask another pair or Ada Ideas for suggestions.</p>"
